From 728de59cc796565f9a36b4f4a8c84e83b767630b Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Muhammad Falak R Wani <falakreyaz@gmail.com>
Date: Wed, 11 Nov 2026 16:30:00 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] tests: run the default-groups lockfile tests on Python 3.14

Origin: Azure Linux (downstream change, not an upstream backport).

crates/uv/tests/project/lock.rs is new since uv 0.12.19, and each of its
12 tests selects Python 3.12, which Azure Linux does not ship. The tests
only run `uv lock` and `uv export` offline on projects that declare
requires-python = ">=3.12", and the lockfile is universal, so any
interpreter that satisfies that bound works. Select Python 3.14 instead;
the expected snapshots are unchanged.

Base source: uv 0.12.24, selected by the locked Fedora dist-git commit:
f174be201fff3ae5543dc62526e570154b933dea
https://src.fedoraproject.org/rpms/uv/c/f174be201fff3ae5543dc62526e570154b933dea

Upstream-Status: Not submitted
Signed-off-by: Muhammad Falak R Wani <falakreyaz@gmail.com>
---
 crates/uv/tests/project/lock.rs | 24 ++++++++++++------------
 1 file changed, 12 insertions(+), 12 deletions(-)

diff --git a/crates/uv/tests/project/lock.rs b/crates/uv/tests/project/lock.rs
